=2 Rhapsodies of Vanadiel
{p:Curio Vendor Moogles|Curio Vendor Moogle} will sell the {p:Key Item} reward once {k:"Rhapsody in Azure"} is obtained from {p:Rhapsodies of Vanadiel}.
=2 Walkthrough
!Warhorse Hoofprint.png|right|Warhorse Hoofprint
* Talk to Naja to receive the {k:Quartz transmitter}.
* Find the **Warhorse Hoofprint** and click on it to place the Quartz Transmitter.
** The **Warhorse Hoofprint** is visible on {p:Widescan} and found in four different zones:
*** {z:Bhaflau Thickets}
*** {z:Caedarva Mire}
*** {z:Mount Zhayolm}
*** {z:Wajaom Woodlands}
* Return to Naja to complete the quest.

